  "case_id": "case_001",
  "title": "The Silent Witness",
  "description": "Dr. Rishabh Malhotra, a clinical psychologist and behavioural analyst, is found dead in his 17th-floor apartment at Blackwood Residency. He sits upright in his study facing an empty chair, a half-finished chess game between them, and a handwritten note on the table is addressed to Detective Aarav Mehra in a hand he knows all too well. Three people were close to Rishabh, and each is keeping something hidden. Aarav has 72 hours to find out who met Rishabh that evening, and why a man he barely knew held a secret about the night Aarav's family died.",
